y Antique Cuirass\",\"text\":\"Purchase Antique Cuirass (2,170 gold) as item 5 in the Roam Conceal Pickoff build for Hilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda#build-roam-conceal-pickoff\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Roam Conceal Pickoff build for Hilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda#build-roam-conceal-pickoff\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5e:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T8c4,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Hilda in Mobile Legends: EXP Bruiser Execute\",\"description\":\"EXP setup for side-lane pressure where Thunder Belt and War Axe reward repeated contact before Execute closes the trade.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Execute Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Warrior Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Warrior Boots (720 gold) as item 1 in the EXP Bruiser Execute build for Hilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda#build-exp-bruiser-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Thunder Belt\",\"text\":\"Purchase Thunder Belt (1,820 gold) as item 2 in the EXP Bruiser Execute build for Hilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda#build-exp-bruiser-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy War Axe\",\"text\":\"Purchase War Axe (2,100 gold) as item 3 in the EXP Bruiser Execute build for Hilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda#build-exp-bruiser-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Oracle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Oracle (1,860 gold) as item 4 in the EXP Bruiser Execute build for Hilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda#build-exp-bruiser-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Queen's Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Queen's Wings (2,250 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Bruiser Execute build for Hilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda#build-exp-bruiser-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the EXP Bruiser Execute build for Hilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda#build-exp-bruiser-execute\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/hilda\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":35,\"name\":\"Hilda\",\"slug\":\"hilda\",\"title\":\"Power of Megalith\",\"role\":[\"Fighter\",\"Tank\"],\"specialty\":[\"Damage\",\"Regen\"],\"lane\":[\"Roam\",\"EXP\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2017,\"stats\":{\"durability\":90,\"offense\":40,\"controlEffect\":40,\"difficulty\":10},\"winRate\":50.72,\"pickRate\":0.56,\"banRate\":8.93,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"zilong\",\"heroName\":\"Zilong\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Hilda excels in prolonged battles. She works well against heroes with lower burst damage. Such as Zilong and Layla.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Hilda excels in prolonged battles. She works well against heroes with lower burst damage. Such as Zilong and Layla.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"thamuz\",\"heroName\":\"Thamuz\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Hilda is countered by heroes with high sustain. Such as Thamuz and Uranus. This is because they can utilize their healing abilities to prevent being executed.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"uranus\",\"heroName\":\"Uranus\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Hilda is countered by heroes with high sustain. Such as Thamuz and Uranus. This is because they can utilize their healing abilities to prevent being executed.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_35f2e88037398136c01b314deb573eb0.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_acd700708dc515f5c63a08f8835a9941.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"8\",\"heroName\":\"Karina\",\"heroSlug\":\"karina\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/1691dbbde8237768590768a90510d5a6.jpg?w=100-100-f7fcc4\",\"tip\":\"Hilda can be teamed up with any hero but it would be better if she will be teamed up with heroes who can cope up with her movement speed when she uses Combat Ritual or with heroes who have disables like she does. It would also be better if she is teamed up with assassins who can hide in a bush where she’s also hiding and focus on the backline of the enemy’s team. It would be an easy 4v5 once that their target is dead since Hilda’s cc + Assassins damage is a very deadly combination\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"18\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_a05a03db633cc03ef3f733d2786073c4.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Hilda counters heroes which are squishy and has low mobility. Most of them are mages, assassins and marksmen since they deal a lot of damage yet are very easy to kill as well. She can focus on targeting the backline which consists of the said roles since they are to be protected and destroy the enemy’s play since tanks are useless without damage dealers.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"40\",\"heroName\":\"Karrie\",\"heroSlug\":\"karrie\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_2ae89c203ad1488fa1af6b7e51dae488.png\",\"tip\":\"Hilda is countered by heroes who deals damage based on the enemy’s HP such as Balmond and Karina, and by heroes who have lots of armor penetration, mostly marksmen such as Moskov, Karrie and Roger. Support such as Diggie with its crowd control abilities and its ultimate skill which is like a purify for all allies also counters Hilda since her crowd control skills are useless while the skill is in-effect.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Blessing of Wilderness\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Hilda recovers 2% HP per second while in the bush. Entering a bush enhances her next Basic Attack, which deals 110 (+130% Total Physical Attack)(+12*Hero Level) Physical Damage to the target, reduces the target's Movement Speed by 40%, and deals 40 (+100% Total Physical Attack)(+10*Hero Level) Physical Damage to enemies behind the target. After using the enhanced Basic Attack, this effect enters a 6s cooldown.\\n\\nHilda's Basic Attack and skills apply a Wilderness Mark on hit, which lasts up to 4s and stacks up to 6 times. Each stack reduces the enemy hero's Hybrid Defense by 3%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hilda recovers 2% HP per second while in the bush. Entering a bush enhances her next Basic Attack, which deals 110\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+130% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+12*Hero Level) \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the target, reduces the target's Movement Speed by 40%, and deals 40\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+10*Hero Level) \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies behind the target. After using the enhanced Basic Attack, this effect enters a 6s cooldown.\\n\\nHilda's Basic Attack and skills apply a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Wilderness Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" on hit, which lasts up to 4s and stacks up to 6 times. Each stack reduces the enemy hero's Hybrid Defense by 3%.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_34b0dddc37a0bd20d686616d9b7b984e.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Combat Ritual\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Hilda gains 60% Movement Speed for 3s and receives a shield that absorbs damage equal to 10% Max HP, lasting 3s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hilda gains 60% Movement Speed for 3s and receives a shield that absorbs damage equal to 10% Max HP, lasting 3s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"10s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c2ffa9fe6df7c70e85144e9250f0f5bf.png\",\"tags\":[\"Speed Up\",\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Art of Hunting\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Hilda locks onto an enemy target, dealing 200 (+90% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage per hit. This skill can be cast up to 3 times. The 2nd attack deals extra damage to nearby enemies. The 3rd attack deals damage to the target and nearby enemies, knocking them back briefly.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hilda locks onto an enemy target, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+90% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" per hit. This skill can be cast up to 3 times. The 2nd attack deals extra damage to nearby enemies. The 3rd attack deals damage to the target and nearby enemies, knocking them back briefly.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2f407178c40dbabccf8d787b2e0e30cc.png\",\"tags\":[\"Damage\",\"CC\"]},{\"name\":\"Power of Wildness\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Hilda launches a powerful slash at the target enemy, dealing 600 (+250% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage and stunning them for 0.2s. Nearby enemies take 60% of the damage.\\n\\nEach stack of Wilderness Mark increases Power of Wildness's damage by 2.5% of the target's Max HP. At max stacks, the extra damage increases to 20% of the target's Max HP.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hilda launches a powerful slash at the target enemy, dealing 600\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+250% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and stunning them for 0.2s. Nearby enemies take 60% of the damage.\\n\\nEach stack of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Wilderness Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" increases \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Power of Wildness\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"'s damage by 2.5% of the target's Max HP. At max stacks, the extra damage increases to 20% of the target's Max HP.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"32s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_323f1e87195d3a50d0c307f239241b61.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"CC\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Her first skill follows, which is Combat Ritual, This is a skill used for chasing and zoning while also dealing a decent amount of damage to her target. Lastly, her second skill which is the Art of Hunting, this also deals damage but this skill is mostly for crowd control, so it can stay at level 1 and can be maxed last.\\nPetrify is very good when used in Hilda, Hilda’s kits contain a lot of crowd control but it targets a single enemy only. Using petrify will help Hilda in controlling the enemies around her target and it also eliminates the chance of her target to escape.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Her first skill follows, which is Combat Ritual, This is a skill used for chasing and zoning while also dealing a decent amount of damage to her target. Lastly, her second skill which is the Art of Hunting, this also deals damage but this skill is mostly for crowd control, so it can stay at level 1 and can be maxed last.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Petrify is very good when used in Hilda, Hilda’s kits contain a lot of crowd control but it targets a single enemy only. Using petrify will help Hilda in controlling the enemies around her target and it also eliminates the chance of her target to escape. \"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"rafaela\",\"heroName\":\"Rafaela\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Hilda works well with tanky heroes, which can create room for her to dish out more damage. Such as Atlas and Tigreal.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Hilda works well with tanky heroes, which can create room for her to dish out more damage. Such as Atlas and Tigreal.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, Hilda should use her Ultimate to dive the back-row heroes, then use her 2nd Skill to deal damage and chase the enemy down with her 1st Skill.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":3530,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_323f1e87195d3a50d0c307f239241b61.png\"},{\"skillId\":3520,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2f407178c40dbabccf8d787b2e0e30cc.png\"},{\"skillId\":3510,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c2ffa9fe6df7c70e85144e9250f0f5bf.png\"},{\"skillId\":3500,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Hilda can use her 1st Skill to close in on a target enemy, and slow them with her Enhanced Basic Attack. She can then follow up with her 2nd Skill to chip away at her target and finish with her Ultimate.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":3510,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c2ffa9fe6df7c70e85144e9250f0f5bf.png\"},{\"skillId\":3500,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":3520,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2f407178c40dbabccf8d787b2e0e30cc.png\"},{\"skillId\":3530,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_323f1e87195d3a50d0c307f239241b61.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Hilda build, counter, and roam strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Thunder Belt + Dominance Ice spike, bush positioning, and when not to pick her in draft.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Hilda is not a tank in the Tigreal sense and not a damage roamer in the Popol sense. She is a bush-positioning mark builder whose ultimate turns into an execute only after the map gives her the free real estate to stack it. Pick her when the map has bushes that matter; bench her when the game happens on open river.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"hilda\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-08-18\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"roam-invade-dire-hit\",\"name\":\"Roam Invade Dire Hit\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\",\"cost\":1820,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\",\"cost\":2170,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\",\"cost\":2150,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\"},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"tank\",\"name\":\"Tank Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"vitality\",\"name\":\"Vitality\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/vitality.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"tenacity\",\"name\":\"Tenacity\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/tenacity.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"concussive-blast\",\"name\":\"Concussive Blast\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/concussive-blast.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"sprint\",\"name\":\"Sprint\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"dire-hit\",\"name\":\"Dire Hit\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against sustained magic poke or burn damage that keeps tagging Hilda before she can reset in a bush.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blade-armor\",\"name\":\"Blade Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when a basic-attack marksman must hit Hilda during objective fights and chase exits.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"guardian-helmet\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy magic threat is low and Hilda needs faster health resets between jungle invades.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default roam setup for invading and stacking Wilderness Mark on the enemy core. The bush-to-bush invade path keeps Force at full stacks, so Power of Wildness lands with the Dire Hit dump on top of it.\",\"totalCost\":10970,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":3420,\"sources\":[\"Thunder Belt\",\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Athena's Shield\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"hpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hpRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":6,\"sources\":[\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Athena's Shield\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":110,\"sources\":[\"Thunder Belt\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":121,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Thunder Belt\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Athena's Shield\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Thunder Belt\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=hilda\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cthunder-belt%2Cdominance-ice%2Cantique-cuirass%2Cathenas-shield%2Cimmortality\u0026blessing=dire-hit\u0026spell=sprint\u0026emblem=tank\u0026talents=vitality%2Ctenacity%2Cconcussive-blast\u0026flex=radiant-armor.athenas-shield%2Cblade-armor.antique-cuirass%2Cguardian-helmet.athenas-shield\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"roam-conceal-pickoff\",\"name\":\"Roam Conceal Pickoff\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\",\"cost\":1820,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\",\"cost\":1880,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\",\"cost\":2170,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\"},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"support\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"pull-yourself-together\",\"name\":\"Pull Yourself Together\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/pull-yourself-together.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"focusing-mark\",\"name\":\"Focusing Mark\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/focusing-mark.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"conceal\",\"name\":\"Conceal\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against one-rotation magic burst that can kill Hilda before bush sustain matters.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"guardian-helmet\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when rotations are constant and Hilda is winning by re-entering fights at higher health than the enemy roam.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blade-armor\",\"name\":\"Blade Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against attack-speed carries that keep firing through Hilda's dive instead of relying on physical skills.\"}],\"notes\":\"Pickoff roam setup that trades some raw tank emblem bulk for faster rotations, Conceal windows, and Focusing Mark burst from allied follow-up.\",\"totalCost\":10700,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":3470,\"sources\":[\"Thunder Belt\",\"Radiant Armor\",\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"hpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hpRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":16,\"sources\":[\"Radiant Armor\",\"Antique Cuirass\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":110,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\",\"Thunder Belt\",\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":113,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Thunder Belt\",\"Radiant Armor\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Thunder Belt\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=hilda\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cdominance-ice%2Cthunder-belt%2Cradiant-armor%2Cantique-cuirass%2Cimmortality\u0026blessing=conceal\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=support\u0026talents=agility%2Cpull-yourself-together%2Cfocusing-mark\u0026flex=athenas-shield.radiant-armor%2Cguardian-helmet.radiant-armor%2Cblade-armor.antique-cuirass\"},{\"slot\":3,\"id\":\"exp-bruiser-execute\",\"name\":\"EXP Bruiser Execute\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\",\"cost\":720,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\",\"cost\":1820,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\"},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"fighter\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"firmness\",\"name\":\"Firmness\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/firmness.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"festival-of-blood\",\"name\":\"Festival of Blood\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/festival-of-blood.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"brave-smite\",\"name\":\"Brave Smite\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/brave-smite.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"execute\",\"name\":\"Execute\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when crowd control or magic chip matters more than repeated physical lane trades.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against healing, shields, or attack-speed threats when anti-sustain matters more than low-health damage reduction.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use only from a clear lead when Hilda can reliably reach backline targets before final Lord fights.\"}],\"notes\":\"EXP setup for side-lane pressure where Thunder Belt and War Axe reward repeated contact before Execute closes the trade.\",\"totalCost\":10870,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":3450,\"sources\":[\"Thunder Belt\",\"War Axe\",\"Oracle\",\"Queen's Wings\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":68,\"sources\":[\"Warrior Boots\",\"Thunder Belt\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"Thunder Belt\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Warrior Boots\",\"Thunder Belt\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Oracle\",\"Queen's Wings\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=hilda\u0026items=warrior-boots%2Cthunder-belt%2Cwar-axe%2Coracle%2Cqueens-wings%2Cimmortality\u0026spell=execute\u0026emblem=fighter\u0026talents=firmness%2Cfestival-of-blood%2Cbrave-smite\u0026flex=tough-boots.warrior-boots%2Cdominance-ice.queens-wings%2Cblade-of-despair.immortality\"}]},\"buildTimestamp\":\"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"patch\":\"2.2.16