oss the fight, while Dominance Ice's Lifebane is a short 5-unit aura that only catches a healer standing close enough to you, which a backline healer rarely does. The two share the Lifebane name so the cut does not stack, but the attack stat on Sea Halberd is a real damage threat on her enhanced basic that Dominance Ice never provides.\"]}]\nae:[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/oracle\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Oracle\"}],\" is the sleeper pick\"]}],\" on bush-heavy maps. Oracle's 25% shield and HP regen boost multiplies her passive bush regen and her S1 shield; against a drafted anti-heal team it gets neutralized, but against a team with zero anti-heal you effectively double-dip on the entire shield stack. Most players slot \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/immortality\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Immortality\"}],\" here by default, which is fine; Oracle is the upgrade when you are ahead and the enemy has no anti-heal.\"]}]\naf:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/guardian-helmet\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Guardian Helmet\"}],\" is a sustain flex option, not a blanket skip. It costs 2500 gold and gives 1800 HP and 20 HP Regen. Recovery activates after five seconds out of combat and restores 2.5% Total HP per second. It has no reduced in-combat state. Defender works separately. When a single damage instance exceeds 500, it recovers 30 (+0.3% Total HP)% of the damage above 500 as HP.\"]}]\nb0:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Hilda already heals in bushes, so judge Recovery as extra reset sustain rather than the whole reason to buy the item. Retreating into a bush is not enough to activate Recovery if you are still in combat. Defender adds a separate large-hit recovery effect that the old \\\"useless in fights\\\" advice ignored. Weigh both benefits against the Physical or Magic Defense slot you would give up. Neither makes Guardian Helmet mandatory.\"}]\nb1:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"Emblem is \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/emblems/tank\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Tank Emblem\"}],\" with the Concussive Blast core: the AOE magic damage proc on basic attack lines up perfectly with her bush enhance because the mark application fires on the same click. \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-1\",{\"href\":\"/emblems/tank\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Vitality\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-2\",{\"href\":\"/emblems/tank\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Tenacity\"}],\" on the standard slots are correct; do not swap to Fighter Emblem, the lifesteal has no good source on her (her single-target damage is mostly ult burst).\"]}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Mistakes that lose Hilda games\"]}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Opening with S1 into the fight's front.\"}],\" S1 is a short-lived personal shield. If you use it to walk into range, the shield is gone before the fight reaches its decision point and you die in the middle rows to the enemy follow-up. Walk into range through bushes, then pop S1 the instant the first enemy CC lands on you; you want the shield to absorb the first CC's damage, not to close the gap.\"]}]\nb4:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Ulting at 1 or 2 marks to secure a kill.\"}],\" The ult's base damage alone will not kill a healthy mid-game squishy; the kill comes from the mark stacks shredding defense and feeding the percent-HP execute. Ulting on 2 marks turns what should be a massive chunk into a chip of damage. Hold ult until you have at least 4 marks, or until the target is already below the execute threshold and the brief stun lands the kill anyway.\"]}]\nb5:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Applying bush enhance on the tank.\"}],\" The enhanced basic comes back on a short cooldown out of bush, which makes each one a precious resource. Every time you use it on the enemy tank instead of the enemy carry you are donating a mark stack to the target whose HP pool makes your ult worst. Walk past the tank to the bush that lets you tag the carry instead.\"]}]\nb6:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Forcing fights before Thunder Belt + Dominance Ice.\"}],\" She has no item power spike before minute 8. A 4-minute gank with no items deals damage to nobody; you end up burning three battle spells for a kill trade that favors the enemy. Roam is farm for tempo objectives and vision, not for pre-6 ganks on other lanes. Let your carry power-farm and punish the map later.\"]}]\nb7:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Playing her like a tank.\"}],\" She is not one. Her base durability is lower than any real main tank's, her S1 shield is a short-lived personal bubble rather than the team-wide engage walls \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/johnson\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Johnson\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-1\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/khufra\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Khufra\"}],\" bring, and she has no peel CC. If your team draft needs a main tank, Hilda is not the answer. She is the answer when your team already has a main tank and you want a second durable body that deals real burst.\"]}]\nb8:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Key tips\"]}]\nb9:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If you see an enemy backline carry walk into any bush on the map during objective setup, that is your window. Bush enhance + S2 lock-on + ult on a 4800-HP marksman from 100 to 0 is her single most-replicated highlight clip for a reason.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nba:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-1\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Your enhanced basic slow is strong and long enough to stand in for a teammate's slow item in the itemization math. If you're on a team with \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\".$a-0\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/aulus\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Aulus\"}],\" or \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\".$a-1\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/yu-zhong\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Yu Zhong\"}],\", you are already carrying the slow they would otherwise need to buy.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nbb:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-2\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"S2's third strike has a knockback that places the target toward you, not away. Positioning before you press the third click decides whether the displacement lands the enemy into your team's follow-up or into their own safety. Always angle the third click so the line between you and the target points at your team.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nbc:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-3\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Against a team with anti-heal (\",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\".$a-0\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/baxia\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Baxia\"}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\".$a-1\",{\"href\":\"/items/sea-halberd\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Sea Halberd\"}],\", Dominance Ice spam), skip \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\".$a-2\",{\"href\":\"/items/oracle\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Oracle\"}],\". The 25% shield and regen boost gets halved immediately on their first hit on you, and you paid 1860 gold for a defense item that gave you a passive that doesn't work.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nbd:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-4\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(255,107,107,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(255,107,107,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#ff6b6b\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"wmoenq\",{\"d\":\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"juzpu7\",{\"d\":\"M12 9v4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"p32p05\",{\"d\":\"M12 17h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#ff6b6b\"},\"children\":\"Warning\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Walking into a bush no longer grants a shield. Since the rework, entering a bush only arms your enhanced basic; your only shield is S1, and the 2.1.88 buff scaled it up to nearly a third of your max HP at max rank. So the answer to incoming burst is to press S1, not to dive into a bush expecting the old shield to save you. Plenty of old guides still describe the bush shield.\"]}]]]}]]}]\n"])</script></body></html>